{
  "title": "CrestApps Commerce: Payments, Subscriptions, Payment Plans and Invoices | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "The CrestApps Commerce modules let an Orchard Core site take payments: sell subscriptions online, set up payment plans for your customers, send invoices and receipts, and keep track of every payment.\n\nEvery payment goes through one checkout, whether a visitor buys a plan, a customer pays an invoice, or a saved card is charged on schedule, and every amount owed is a transaction, so there is one record of what each customer owes and has paid.\n\nIn this video:\n• How the checkout, payment providers, transactions and the selling modules fit together\n• Connecting Stripe, and coupons\n• Selling plans with Subscriptions, and whole websites with Subscriptions Sites\n• Installment plans: the down payment, Charge now and cancelling\n• Transactions, reminders, invoices with a pay link, payments and refunds\n• Settings, recipes, and extending the modules in code",
